WEBVTT

00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:30.124
(Laughter)

00:00:30.148 --> 00:00:32.966
What went wrong between
the design studio and the factory?

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:35.394
Today, I don't want to talk
about beautiful babies,

00:00:35.418 --> 00:00:38.159
I want to talk about the awkward
adolescence of design --

00:00:38.183 --> 00:00:42.761
those sort of dorky teenage years

00:00:42.785 --> 00:00:45.728
where you're trying to figure out
how the world works.

00:00:46.307 --> 00:00:47.942
I'm going to start with an example

00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:50.394
from some work that we did
on newborn health.

00:00:50.418 --> 00:00:52.050
So here's a problem:

00:00:52.074 --> 00:00:56.089
four million babies around the world,
mostly in developing countries,

00:00:56.113 --> 00:00:58.474
die every year
before their first birthday,

00:00:58.498 --> 00:01:00.326
even before their first month of life.